{"id":"4d625637d136b307","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Diamond Sequence Candidate","display":"df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate — ZFC Comb8 Diamond Sequence Candidate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate — ZFC Comb8 Diamond Sequence Candidate","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate — ZFC Comb8 Diamond Sequence Candidate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,S,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(A,S,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8DiamondSequenceCandidate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8DiamondSequenceCandidate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}candidate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8DiamondSequenceCandidate}_S(A,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,S,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;(A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in S:X\\cap\\alpha=A(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}candidate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8DiamondSequenceCandidate}_S(A,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,S,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;(A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in S:X\\cap\\alpha=A(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The function clause guarantees a unique guess <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\alpha)\">\\(A(\\alpha)\\)</span> at every index; a relation having domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> would not suffice.</li>\n<li>值域由真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 收紧为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>，因此该函数条件现在可由集合函数谓词表达。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,S,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8DiamondSequenceCandidate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}candidate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8DiamondSequenceCandidate}_S(A,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,S,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;(A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in S:X\\cap\\alpha=A(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"A(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1709","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate.md|58-df-zfc-comb8-diamond-sequence-candidate]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b802c3dd76418d95","36d7463d215be751"]}